                <p>* Notes 1, 2, 3 and 4—See Appendix</p>
                <p># CSAF believes about 75 is the correct figure as of 1 March 1962.</p>
                <p>## CSAF believes about 250 is the correct figure.</p>
                <p>### There is some evidence, not yet conclusive, that the USSR is showing activity
                    toward acquiring a nuclear delivery capability for tactical fighters. USCINCEUR
                    has expressed a belief, although he has no positive proof, that about one-half
                    of the Soviet fighter-bombers possess a nuclear delivery capability.</p>
                <p>#### It is estimated that some in class cruise type missile subs are probably
                    operational now (350 nm cruise missile)</p>
